[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0010","text":"哎呀……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0020","text":"夏叶小姐……\n您辛苦了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0030","text":"凛世也来事务所了呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0040","text":"是的……\n方才一直在……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0050","text":"与制作人……\n进行商谈……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0060","text":"这样啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0070","text":"你这是要回去了吗？\n方便的话，一起去喝杯茶怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0080","text":"最近一直没什么机会见面……\n偶尔也想聊聊天呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0090","text":"呵呵……\n好的……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_21300100_01_0100","text":"那就这么定了！\n走吧……！"}]
